### 1. 정상 회원 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/members

### 2. 정상 회원 단건 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/members/1

### 3. 404 Not Found - 존재하지 않는 회원 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/members/999

### 4. 201 Created - 정상 회원 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "no": 4,
  "name": "이순신",
  "age": 45
}

### 5. 400 Bad Request - 이름 누락
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "no": 5,
  "name": "",
  "age": 22
}

### 6. 400 Bad Request - 중복 회원 번호
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "no": 4,
  "name": "중복 회원",
  "age": 30
}

### 7. 400 Bad Request - JSON 타입 불일치
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "no": 6,
  "name": "강감찬",
  "age": "스무 살"
}

### 8. 500 Internal Server Error - 예상하지 못한 서버 오류
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/members/server-error
